sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as React tab
  participant Client as API client
  participant Proxy as Vite proxy
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Session as In-memory SESSION
  participant Scheme as PPSEB primitives

  User->>UI: Enter record, keyword and query keyword
  UI->>Client: encryptSearch(request)
  Client->>Proxy: POST /api/encrypt-search (JSON)
  Proxy->>API: Forward to 127.0.0.1:8000
  API->>Session: Read params, period keys, mu and PKE anchor
  Session-->>API: Current period state
  API->>Scheme: PEKS encrypt + generate trapdoor
  Scheme-->>API: CT1, CT2, Trap, trace events
  API->>Scheme: Verify(CT1, CT2, Trap)
  Scheme-->>API: match and verifier output
  API->>Scheme: Encrypt record; decrypt only when match
  Scheme-->>API: Ciphertext and optional plaintext
  API-->>Proxy: result + trace + params
  Proxy-->>Client: JSON response
  Client-->>UI: Resolve result or surface error
  UI-->>User: Match/no-match, plaintext if matched, trace
